Hi,
	You're using the right server, just the wrong branch.  Branches allow 
you to take a copy of the work off the trunk (main branch) and work on 
it for a while without disturbing everything else.  Then once all the 
work's been done and is mostly stable, you can merge the branch back 
into the trunk.
	The particular branch I think you're after is BETA20 and you can view 
it under sourceforge's ViewCVS module (at the bottom of a page that has 
files under different branches you can select which branch you want to 
look at).  I don't personally know the CVS commands for checking out 
branches, but the man pages are the place to find out.
	Hope this helps,
	Mike  5:)

